{'symbol': 'DAL', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'DELTA AIR LINES, INC. ANNOUNCES TRAFFIC RESULTS FOR THE MONTH AND YEAR TO DATE ENDED SEPTEMBER 2019', 'text': 'DELTA AIR LINES, INC. ANNOUNCED TRAFFIC RESULTS FOR THE MONTH AND YEAR TO DATE ENDED SEPTEMBER 2019. FOR THE MONTH, THE COMPANY REPORTED RPMS WAS 19,564,427,000 AGAINST 18,311,866,000 A YEAR AGO. ASMS WAS 22,928,700,000 AGAINST 21,902,212,000 A YEAR AGO. LOAD FACTOR WAS 85.3% AGAINST 83.6% A YEAR AGO. PASSENGERS BOARDED WAS 16,475,647 AGAINST 15,250,053 A YEAR AGO. CARGO TON MILES WAS 167,788,000 AGAINST 187,418,000 A YEAR AGO.FOR THE YEAR TO DATE ENDED SEPTEMBER 2019, THE COMPANY REPORTED RPMS WAS 181,657,733,000 AGAINST 172,001,854,000 A YEAR AGO. ASMS WAS 209,920,934,000 AGAINST 200,841,665,000 A YEAR AGO. LOAD FACTOR WAS 86.5% AGAINST 85.6% A YEAR AGO. PASSENGERS BOARDED WAS 154,193,180 AGAINST 145,188,449 A YEAR AGO. CARGO TON MILES WAS 1,502,645,000 AGAINST 1,651,369,000 A YEAR AGO.'}